@host = http://localhost:5122

### Upcoming races
GET {{host}}/api/v1/races
Accept: application/json

### Plan for a catalogue race
POST {{host}}/api/v1/plans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "raceSlug": "comrades-2027",
  "goalTime": "10:30:00",
  "runDays": ["Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Saturday", "Sunday"],
  "longRunDay": "Sunday",
  "currentWeeklyKm": 40,
  "experience": "Regular",
  "strengthDays": ["Monday", "Thursday"]
}

### Plan for any race
POST {{host}}/api/v1/plans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "raceName": "Parkrun PB",
  "distanceKm": 5,
  "raceDate": "2027-01-16",
  "goalTime": "00:24:30",
  "runDays": ["Monday", "Wednesday", "Friday", "Saturday"],
  "longRunDay": "Saturday",
  "experience": "New"
}

### Invalid request -> 400 ValidationProblemDetails
POST {{host}}/api/v1/plans
Content-Type: application/json

{ "distanceKm": 42.2, "raceDate": "2027-05-01", "goalTime": "00:03:00", "runDays": ["Sunday"], "longRunDay": "Monday" }

### Predict a marathon from a 10K
GET {{host}}/api/v1/predictions?fromKm=10&time=00:50:00&toKm=42.195

### Health
GET {{host}}/health/ready
